蕾丝图案\nStylish handle made from a combination of matte black metal and soft, blush-colored leather, with a sleek, ergonomic design\n时尚的手柄，结合哑光黑色金属和柔和的腮红色皮革，设计流线型且符合人体工程学\nHigh-end handle made from a combination of polished sterling silver and natural amethyst, with a smooth, cool touch and a luxurious feel\n高端手柄，结合抛光纯银和天然紫水晶，触感光滑凉爽，奢华感十足\nChic handle made from a combination of clear acrylic and rose gold, with a sleek, modern aesthetic and a subtle, iridescent effect\n时尚的手柄，结合透明亚克力和玫瑰金，现代流线型美感，带有微妙的虹彩效果\nElegant handle made from a combination of white marble and 18K gold, with a smooth, cool touch and a classic, timeless design\n优雅的手柄，结合白色大理石和18K金，触感光滑凉爽，经典永恒的设计"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [698.7721557617188, 265.2633056640625], "pos": [2260.059814453125, 1147.041015625], "id": 121, "properties": {}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "workspace_info": {"saveLock": false, "id": "IiRRKKkkEc9M4Xl1vD4ES"}, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1341.1201488476934, -433.9691609303354], "scale": 0.8769226950000015}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "手动上传蒙版（可选）", "bounding": [392, 1133, 1554, 683]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "1.加载模型和图像", "bounding": [393, 11, 786, 1115]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "2.获取重绘区域遮罩", "bounding": [1186, 387, 758, 741]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "3.输入提示词", "bounding": [1951, 388, 1215, 880]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "4.局部重绘获取图像", "bounding": [3172, 387, 1869, 1041]}], "links": [[1, 10, 0, 14, 1, "IMAGE"], [18, 18, 0, 19, 0, "IMAGE"], [20, 15, 0, 23, 0, "*"], [139, 10, 0, 107, 0, "IMAGE"], [140, 23, 0, 107, 1, "SEGS"], [142, 91, 0, 107, 6, "CONDITIONING"], [146, 107, 0, 14, 0, "IMAGE"], [148, 110, 0, 107, 5, "CONDITIONING"], [149, 110, 0,